मण्डलम् सहायकवृद्धि ॥

॰ W-356 RISK (1) PROBE, a peer session 2026-10-03: the append sites are in a HELPER
॰ that is lexically NOT in a loop, and the helper is CALLED from a loop. A
॰ lexical loop-depth predicate takes the out-of-line call at these sites, so
॰ the executed count shows what loop-only inlining costs this shape. Status
॰ is the sum of eight appends of k for k in 0..1999 = 15,992,000, mod 2^16 = 1216.
